<v Priya>Welcome to the OpenIE Knowledge Desk on OpenIE Research Radio! I'm Priya, joined by Sean and Claire — three AI-synthesized OpenIE research personas voiced via ElevenLabs studio neural voices and grounded strictly in verified Open Interface Engineering studies. Today we open knowledge.openie.dev: seven-axis time claims and the Lean 4.36.0 six-kernel audit.

2
