<v Priya>Picture how internet rumor laundering works: one blog invents a number, three sites quote the blog, and a chatbot cites all three as consensus! Or imagine a medical chart overwriting Tuesday's blood draw on Friday without separating when the lab happened from when the edit happened.

3
